### 2021A&A...652A..98G: The Galaxy Activity, Torus, and Outflow Survey (GATOS). I. ALMA images of dusty molecular tori in Seyfert galaxies (2021; agn_and_quasars, nearby_galaxies; large_program_or_survey)
